WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.430
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.700 --> 01:48.030
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.100 --> 01:50.990
[Episode 7]

4
02:01.350 --> 02:02.150
It finally succeeded!

5
02:02.150 --> 02:02.850
-It succeeded! -It succeeded!

6
02:02.850 --> 02:04.310
The experiment is over!

7
02:04.700 --> 02:05.790
Good job, Yun Li!

8
02:07.450 --> 02:08.810
The classic trial-and-error method

9
02:08.810 --> 02:09.710
and the adaptive control method

10
02:09.710 --> 02:11.090
have both been tried 3 times.

11
02:11.090 --> 02:12.910
The parameters should be optimal now.

12
02:12.910 --> 02:13.690
Good job, Yun Li.

13
02:13.690 --> 02:15.620
We can report to the professor now.

14
02:15.860 --> 02:16.860
We are all awesome.

15
02:16.860 --> 02:17.300
Yes.

16
02:17.300 --> 02:17.810
Good job, everyone.

17
02:17.810 --> 02:18.470
Good job.

18
02:21.980 --> 02:23.130
[Tang Lin]

19
02:26.400 --> 02:27.340
Hello, Tangy.

20
02:27.560 --> 02:28.250
What are you doing?

21
02:28.250 --> 02:29.300
Why didn't you reply to my messages?

22
02:29.300 --> 02:30.910
I... I was doing an experiment.

23
02:30.910 --> 02:32.020
I didn't check my phone.

24
02:32.020 --> 02:33.820
Let's go out for dinner tonight.

25
02:34.620 --> 02:35.960
Why the sudden treat?

26
02:36.060 --> 02:37.300
Did you win the lottery?

27
02:37.300 --> 02:38.310
I saw a restaurant online.

28
02:38.310 --> 02:39.690
They say it's really good.

29
02:39.690 --> 02:41.020
Let's go try it together.

30
02:41.020 --> 02:42.710
Okay, see you tonight.

31
02:42.710 --> 02:43.400
Okay.

32
02:44.800 --> 02:45.500
Bye-bye.

33
03:00.410 --> 03:00.970
Hello?

34
03:01.430 --> 03:02.030
Shize,

35
03:02.690 --> 03:04.120
Grandma's birthday dinner is tonight.

36
03:04.120 --> 03:05.150
Don't forget.

37
03:14.200 --> 03:16.960
-Happy birthday, Grandma! -Happy birthday, Grandma!

38
03:16.960 --> 03:17.750
Thank you!

39
03:18.800 --> 03:20.150
Thank you. Let's clink glasses!

40
03:20.150 --> 03:20.800
Okay.

41
03:22.910 --> 03:23.690
Did Shize arrange

42
03:23.690 --> 03:25.490
everything on this table today?

43
03:25.750 --> 03:27.090
He's so thoughtful.

44
03:27.310 --> 03:28.620
Shize arranged it.

45
03:28.860 --> 03:29.650
You see,

46
03:29.990 --> 03:30.650
only

47
03:30.670 --> 03:32.020
two professors like Uncle and Aunt

48
03:32.020 --> 03:32.860
could raise

49
03:32.860 --> 03:34.410
such an excellent child.

50
03:35.690 --> 03:36.500
Shize,

51
03:36.860 --> 03:38.020
wish your mom a happy birthday

52
03:38.020 --> 03:39.350
and say something nice.

53
03:43.520 --> 03:44.310
Mom,

54
03:45.710 --> 03:46.640
happy birthday.

55
03:48.980 --> 03:51.910
You don't reply to messages in the family group chat.

56
03:52.000 --> 03:54.710
So you finally decided to show up today?

57
03:56.690 --> 03:57.500
Exactly.

58
03:57.960 --> 03:59.560
If it weren't for your mom's birthday,

59
03:59.560 --> 04:01.360
it would be hard for us to see you.

60
04:07.060 --> 04:07.920
Here, Grandma.

61
04:08.000 --> 04:08.960
Let me toast you.

62
04:09.310 --> 04:10.590
Happy birthday.

63
04:10.590 --> 04:12.120
May you stay young forever.

64
04:12.120 --> 04:12.960
Happy birthday, Grandma!

65
04:12.960 --> 04:13.800
Happy birthday, Grandma!

66
04:13.800 --> 04:14.910
Okay, thank you.

67
04:26.800 --> 04:28.560
The food here is so delicious.

68
04:29.190 --> 04:30.810
Xia is missing out.

69
04:31.060 --> 04:31.810
I sent her a message,

70
04:31.810 --> 04:33.340
but she hasn't replied yet.

71
04:36.450 --> 04:38.250
She hasn't replied to me either.

72
04:38.250 --> 04:39.450
She must be busy.

73
04:43.300 --> 04:44.000
Lili,

74
04:44.000 --> 04:44.750
look at Fu Zhengchu's

75
04:44.750 --> 04:45.680
post on Moments.

76
04:52.370 --> 04:54.980
Why are you suddenly

77
04:55.010 --> 04:56.670
so interested in Fu Zhengchu?

78
04:57.010 --> 04:58.159
I just saw it.

79
05:02.950 --> 05:03.950
"My grandma said

80
05:04.050 --> 05:05.310
birthdays should be celebrated in style."

81
05:05.310 --> 05:05.750
Today

82
05:05.750 --> 05:07.610
is Fu Shize's mother's birthday.

83
05:08.510 --> 05:10.170
Why don't you leave a comment?

84
05:11.810 --> 05:13.750
What should I comment?

85
05:14.160 --> 05:16.420
"Happy birthday, Mother-in-Law."

86
05:16.660 --> 05:18.300
Don't talk nonsense.

87
05:19.510 --> 05:20.250
They are clearly

88
05:20.250 --> 05:21.660
a family of scholars.

89
05:21.720 --> 05:22.360
This way,

90
05:22.360 --> 05:23.750
after you get married,

91
05:23.750 --> 05:25.120
your parents-in-law will be reasonable.

92
05:25.120 --> 05:26.250
Isn't that great?

93
05:26.710 --> 05:27.680
Think about it.

94
05:28.100 --> 05:29.130
Think about what?

95
05:29.130 --> 05:30.660
I can't win him over anyway.

96
05:33.230 --> 05:34.960
Did you give him the crepe roll?

97
05:35.240 --> 05:36.040
Yes.

98
05:36.390 --> 05:37.600
Did he say anything?

99
05:38.390 --> 05:41.560
Does "thank you" count?

100
05:41.890 --> 05:42.880
Hell no.

101
05:46.600 --> 05:49.560
They say it's easy for a girl to chase a boy.

102
05:49.560 --> 05:51.500
Why is it so hard for me?

103
05:52.500 --> 05:53.159
Why don't you

104
05:53.159 --> 05:54.830
just give up now?

105
05:55.360 --> 05:56.600
Actually, Xia's uncle

106
05:56.600 --> 05:57.950
isn't that great.

107
05:58.800 --> 06:01.300
He just has good looks

108
06:01.330 --> 06:02.300
and a good family background.

109
06:02.300 --> 06:02.600
But—

110
06:02.600 --> 06:04.250
He always has a stern face.

111
06:04.250 --> 06:05.560
And you don't dare to talk to him.

112
06:05.560 --> 06:06.250
You two look like

113
06:06.250 --> 06:07.650
you're performing mime.

114
06:07.740 --> 06:09.940
He's just naturally quiet.

115
06:11.330 --> 06:12.830
Is it possible

116
06:12.890 --> 06:14.560
that you're just attracted

117
06:14.560 --> 06:15.560
by his good looks?

118
06:19.690 --> 06:21.690
I could stare at

119
06:22.100 --> 06:23.500
Fu Shize's face forever.

120
06:24.100 --> 06:25.050
Yun Li.

121
06:25.360 --> 06:26.800
Can good looks feed you?

122
06:27.160 --> 06:29.490
You'll get tired of that face eventually.

123
06:30.000 --> 06:31.040
Let me tell you.

124
06:31.190 --> 06:32.360
A man

125
06:32.360 --> 06:34.159
shouldn't just have good looks.

126
06:34.300 --> 06:35.930
The most important thing is a good temper.

127
06:35.930 --> 06:37.790
Otherwise, what if he abuses you?

128
06:37.950 --> 06:39.570
He's actually a nice guy.

129
06:40.300 --> 06:42.240
If he's so good,

130
06:42.300 --> 06:43.700
why don't you ask him out?

131
06:44.500 --> 06:45.159
I...

132
06:46.890 --> 06:47.770
Never mind.

133
06:52.330 --> 06:54.500
That's such a pity.

134
06:55.060 --> 06:56.330
If that face

135
06:56.330 --> 06:58.540
is only for other women to see from now on,

136
06:58.540 --> 06:59.300
the moon in your heart

137
06:59.300 --> 07:00.360
will be taken away.

138
07:02.540 --> 07:06.100
From now on, the bright moon will shine on another woman,

139
07:06.950 --> 07:08.500
but it won't shine on you.

140
07:10.360 --> 07:11.160
That won't do.

141
07:14.630 --> 07:15.430
Zhengchu.

142
07:15.500 --> 07:16.890
What year are you in college?

143
07:16.890 --> 07:17.690
Sophomore.

144
07:18.100 --> 07:19.190
How are your studies?

145
07:19.190 --> 07:21.250
Are you planning to go to grad school?

146
07:21.500 --> 07:22.500
Probably.

147
07:22.540 --> 07:23.600
What do you mean by "probably"?

148
07:23.600 --> 07:24.930
You definitely should.

149
07:25.130 --> 07:26.790
Follow your uncle's example.

150
07:27.100 --> 07:28.690
How can I compare to my uncle?

151
07:28.690 --> 07:29.510
He's a top student,

152
07:29.510 --> 07:30.930
and he's already been admitted to a PhD program.

153
07:30.930 --> 07:32.920
Just eat some radish.

154
07:34.870 --> 07:35.680
Shize,

155
07:36.370 --> 07:38.630
you've been slacking off for over a year.

156
07:38.810 --> 07:39.930
Isn't it time to go back to school

157
07:39.930 --> 07:41.130
and finish your PhD?

158
07:45.420 --> 07:46.950
I haven't thought about it.

159
07:47.270 --> 07:48.330
Listen to your mom.

160
07:48.570 --> 07:49.870
Hurry up and finish your PhD,

161
07:49.870 --> 07:51.430
so we can have peace of mind.

162
07:51.810 --> 07:52.680
After you graduate,

163
07:52.680 --> 07:53.510
whatever plans

164
07:53.510 --> 07:54.240
or ideas you have,

165
07:54.240 --> 07:55.680
it won't be too late.

166
07:57.120 --> 07:57.920
Grandma,

167
07:57.980 --> 07:58.920
don't worry.

168
07:59.570 --> 08:00.680
Shize is with me now,

169
08:00.680 --> 08:01.870
and he's doing great.

170
08:01.870 --> 08:03.040
With Shize joining us,

171
08:03.040 --> 08:03.980
EAW's

172
08:03.980 --> 08:04.530
VR technology

173
08:04.530 --> 08:06.190
has made a huge breakthrough.

174
08:07.180 --> 08:08.310
If a person can't even

175
08:08.310 --> 08:09.570
finish their studies,

176
08:09.770 --> 08:10.630
what kind of achievements can they make

177
08:10.630 --> 08:12.010
in scientific research?

178
08:12.010 --> 08:14.270
I think you guys are just messing around.

179
08:15.220 --> 08:17.130
My company is doing very well.

180
08:18.740 --> 08:19.810
Society is developing

181
08:19.810 --> 08:20.680
so fast now,

182
08:21.220 --> 08:23.350
and your peers are all moving forward.

183
08:24.240 --> 08:25.300
You're the only one

184
08:25.540 --> 08:27.200
still stuck in the same place,

185
08:27.390 --> 08:29.050
without any sense of urgency.

186
08:30.100 --> 08:31.000
I don't care.

187
08:32.340 --> 08:34.000
What kind of attitude is that?

188
08:34.630 --> 08:35.340
How did we

189
08:35.340 --> 08:36.740
raise you?

190
08:37.150 --> 08:38.280
When facing setbacks and difficulties,

191
08:38.280 --> 08:39.740
you must learn to be strong

192
08:39.740 --> 08:41.289
and overcome your own weaknesses,

193
08:41.289 --> 08:42.500
instead of giving up on yourself

194
08:42.500 --> 08:44.169
and wallowing in degradation!

195
08:44.169 --> 08:44.940
After you reported

196
08:44.940 --> 08:45.980
Professor Che back then,

197
08:45.980 --> 08:47.200
he was fired

198
08:47.240 --> 08:48.630
and punished.

199
08:49.030 --> 08:50.480
What more do you want?

200
08:50.700 --> 08:52.830
What does it matter if he was punished?

201
08:54.440 --> 08:55.770
Can it change anything?

202
08:55.770 --> 08:56.630
Fu Shize!

203
09:02.940 --> 09:03.740
Aunt.

204
09:03.940 --> 09:04.740
Aunt.

205
09:05.030 --> 09:06.200
Calm down.

206
09:06.790 --> 09:07.600
Shize,

207
09:08.240 --> 09:09.370
don't blame your parents

208
09:09.370 --> 09:10.570
for being so anxious.

209
09:10.940 --> 09:12.100
I also think there's absolutely

210
09:12.100 --> 09:13.980
no need to torture yourself like this.

211
09:13.980 --> 09:14.630
That incident

212
09:14.630 --> 09:16.090
wasn't your fault anyway.

213
09:16.340 --> 09:18.080
Besides, it's been so long,

214
09:18.100 --> 09:19.760
and it won't change anything.

215
09:20.390 --> 09:21.740
We all know that

216
09:21.740 --> 09:22.890
you are very sad.

217
09:35.000 --> 09:35.600
What are you sending?

218
09:35.600 --> 09:36.390
Let me see.

219
09:43.370 --> 09:44.770
H-He's calling on video.

220
09:44.770 --> 09:46.310
Answer it quickly.

221
09:46.340 --> 09:47.120
What should I say?

222
09:47.120 --> 09:47.740
I...

223
09:48.080 --> 09:48.870
Just ask him

224
09:48.910 --> 09:49.580
when he's free

225
09:49.580 --> 09:50.380
to go on a date.

226
09:57.800 --> 09:58.890
Hello, Lili.

227
10:03.720 --> 10:05.370
Are you guys having a party?

228
10:05.410 --> 10:06.200
Yeah.

229
10:06.340 --> 10:07.740
We just finished dinner.

230
10:08.130 --> 10:09.220
Why is it you?

231
10:09.320 --> 10:10.320
Where's your uncle?

232
10:10.320 --> 10:11.120
Uncle.

233
10:13.080 --> 10:14.340
She's looking for you.

234
10:15.870 --> 10:17.520
Uncle, why are you ignoring her?

235
10:17.520 --> 10:18.830
Lili, I'm sorry.

236
10:19.030 --> 10:20.620
My uncle is a little bit...

237
10:20.840 --> 10:21.630
rude today.

238
10:22.270 --> 10:23.600
I haven't even seen her.

239
10:23.740 --> 10:24.800
How can I say hello?

240
10:29.740 --> 10:30.820
Long time no see.

241
10:33.510 --> 10:34.130
Hello.

242
10:36.030 --> 10:37.970
Yun Li, what are you talking about?

243
10:43.580 --> 10:45.100
Sang Yan opened a bar,

244
10:45.860 --> 10:46.790
called Overtime.

245
10:46.790 --> 10:47.890
Do you want to go check it out?

246
10:47.890 --> 10:48.750
I want to go too.

247
10:50.480 --> 10:51.290
Lili,

248
10:51.360 --> 10:52.150
we have something to do,

249
10:52.150 --> 10:53.450
so we'll talk to you later.

250
10:53.450 --> 10:55.180
Are you guys going to Overtime?

251
10:55.240 --> 10:57.050
We happen to be going there too.

252
10:58.340 --> 10:59.530
I heard that place

253
10:59.530 --> 11:00.250
has really good business.

254
11:00.250 --> 11:01.440
How about we go first

255
11:01.440 --> 11:02.700
and save us some seats?

256
11:02.750 --> 11:03.360
Okay.

257
11:03.360 --> 11:04.420
See you later then.

258
11:05.740 --> 11:06.600
See you later.

259
11:08.600 --> 11:09.840
Nice move.

260
11:10.960 --> 11:11.790
Well done.

261
11:42.250 --> 11:43.000
Welcome.

262
11:43.000 --> 11:44.340
Hello, welcome.

263
11:46.010 --> 11:48.240
Here's your umbrella. Thank you.

264
11:48.550 --> 11:49.030
Okay.

265
11:51.670 --> 11:52.740
This is...

266
11:53.570 --> 11:54.960
These are all to be destroyed.

267
11:54.960 --> 11:55.760
They're free.

268
11:57.670 --> 11:58.480
Um,

269
11:59.200 --> 12:00.130
I'm off work today.

270
12:00.130 --> 12:01.730
Do you want to walk together?

271
12:03.390 --> 12:04.340
Wait for me.

272
12:21.540 --> 12:23.360
[High School Must-Solve Problems]

273
12:30.120 --> 12:32.050
Are you also a high school sophomore?

274
12:32.050 --> 12:33.310
Yeah, how did you know?

275
12:34.250 --> 12:36.000
I just saw your workbook.

276
12:37.580 --> 12:38.630
What about you?

277
12:38.860 --> 12:40.060
I'm also a sophomore.

278
12:40.700 --> 12:42.100
You're also a sophomore?

279
12:42.500 --> 12:44.050
Then... we are

280
12:44.050 --> 12:44.750
in the same school

281
12:44.750 --> 12:45.650
and the same grade.

282
12:45.650 --> 12:47.580
How come I haven't seen you before?

283
12:48.860 --> 12:51.220
Maybe I'm a bit introverted.

284
12:53.290 --> 12:54.650
I forgot to introduce myself.

285
12:54.650 --> 12:55.620
My name is Yun Ye.

286
12:55.700 --> 12:56.510
Yun, meaning "cloud,"

287
12:56.510 --> 12:57.910
and Ye, meaning "field."

288
13:04.320 --> 13:05.650
My name is Yin Yunyi.

289
13:05.960 --> 13:06.910
I know your name.

290
13:09.720 --> 13:11.450
I saw your name badge last time.

291
13:14.320 --> 13:15.390
Our names

292
13:15.390 --> 13:16.700
are only one character apart.

293
13:16.700 --> 13:17.500
Yun Ye.

294
13:17.550 --> 13:18.360
Yunyi.

295
13:22.100 --> 13:23.250
How do you have time

296
13:23.250 --> 13:24.980
to work at a convenience store?

297
13:26.250 --> 13:27.500
It's not really a part-time job.

298
13:27.500 --> 13:30.430
I just help out at my relative's place occasionally.

299
13:31.240 --> 13:33.570
My family is too strict with my allowance.

300
13:33.700 --> 13:34.620
Same here.

301
13:36.160 --> 13:37.620
Is that why you always buy

302
13:37.620 --> 13:39.220
food that's about to expire?

303
13:42.410 --> 13:43.550
The allowance my family gives me

304
13:43.550 --> 13:44.750
is fixed.

305
13:44.890 --> 13:46.200
I have to save money

306
13:46.700 --> 13:47.510
to buy things

307
13:47.510 --> 13:48.790
that I like.

308
13:50.510 --> 13:52.480
Then you can be like me

309
13:52.620 --> 13:54.350
and earn some extra money here.

310
13:54.480 --> 13:55.630
I don't have time.

311
13:55.870 --> 13:57.330
I have to go to cram school.

312
13:58.050 --> 13:58.570
No wonder

313
13:58.570 --> 13:59.980
you always come so late.

314
14:00.820 --> 14:02.420
What classes are you taking?

315
14:02.740 --> 14:03.530
English.

316
14:04.830 --> 14:07.030
I'm going to study abroad in the future.

317
14:39.010 --> 14:40.670
This bar looks pretty good.

318
14:42.010 --> 14:42.820
Xia.

319
14:43.240 --> 14:44.170
Tangy, over here.

320
14:44.170 --> 14:44.910
Xia.

321
14:47.170 --> 14:48.840
Lili, you look so pretty today.

322
14:48.840 --> 14:49.370
Of course.

323
14:49.370 --> 14:51.170
Tangy put together a look for me.

324
14:51.220 --> 14:52.030
Have a seat.

325
14:58.770 --> 14:59.580
Lili.

326
14:59.580 --> 15:00.980
You look so pretty today,

327
15:00.980 --> 15:02.580
quite different from usual.

328
15:02.910 --> 15:03.720
Thank you.

329
15:04.910 --> 15:06.370
Are you here

330
15:06.370 --> 15:07.530
to find a boyfriend?

331
15:07.530 --> 15:09.390
You really don't know how to talk.

332
15:10.770 --> 15:11.740
Can't you learn from Lili

333
15:11.740 --> 15:12.670
and be a bit gentler?

334
15:12.670 --> 15:13.080
Coming here,

335
15:13.080 --> 15:14.630
you didn't even change your clothes.

336
15:14.630 --> 15:16.090
None of your business.

337
15:18.280 --> 15:19.080
It's fine.

338
15:20.720 --> 15:22.080
Why is it just the two of you?

339
15:22.080 --> 15:23.280
Where are the others?

340
15:24.320 --> 15:25.510
Qingsong went to find the bar owner

341
15:25.510 --> 15:26.370
to chat.

342
15:27.080 --> 15:27.910
This place

343
15:27.910 --> 15:29.770
is also opened by Mr. Xu's friend?

344
15:31.270 --> 15:32.170
When Fu Zhengchu was a kid,

345
15:32.170 --> 15:33.790
he even chased after the owner's sister.

346
15:33.790 --> 15:34.480
Congsheng.

347
15:34.530 --> 15:35.390
That was so many years ago.

348
15:35.390 --> 15:35.890
It's fine.

349
15:35.890 --> 15:36.690
Stop talking.

350
15:37.630 --> 15:38.840
Really?

351
15:39.200 --> 15:40.130
What kind of girl is she?

352
15:40.130 --> 15:40.940
Is she pretty?

353
15:41.630 --> 15:42.720
Anyway, prettier than you

354
15:42.720 --> 15:43.920
and gentler than you.

355
15:49.260 --> 15:49.830
Fu...

356
15:50.990 --> 15:53.310
Did Fu Shize also go to say hi?

357
15:53.580 --> 15:55.440
Uncle is sitting at the bar.

358
16:04.870 --> 16:06.080
Around Fu Shize,

359
16:06.080 --> 16:08.140
has there never been any other woman?

360
16:08.510 --> 16:09.410
How is that possible?

361
16:09.410 --> 16:10.220
With his looks,

362
16:10.220 --> 16:11.720
even if he does nothing,

363
16:11.720 --> 16:13.370
many women would lean on him.

364
16:13.510 --> 16:14.150
Then why hasn't he

365
16:14.150 --> 16:16.010
been in a relationship even once?

366
16:16.370 --> 16:17.220
He is so aloof

367
16:17.220 --> 16:18.350
and ignores people.

368
16:22.750 --> 16:24.220
Then if a girl

369
16:24.220 --> 16:25.350
wants to pursue him,

370
16:25.410 --> 16:26.270
do you think

371
16:26.870 --> 16:28.130
it's highly possible?

372
16:29.770 --> 16:31.390
I think

373
16:32.270 --> 16:34.770
the success rate is zero.

374
16:35.510 --> 16:36.270
He is so aloof

375
16:36.270 --> 16:36.980
and ignores people.

376
16:36.980 --> 16:38.480
Who would go to that trouble?

377
16:38.480 --> 16:39.530
I think so too.

378
16:41.840 --> 16:42.840
Then what if someone

379
16:42.840 --> 16:44.700
insists on going to that trouble?

380
16:46.000 --> 16:48.550
No one would be that stupid, right?

381
16:53.080 --> 16:54.010
Are you alone?

382
17:00.960 --> 17:03.530
Um, I'll go order a drink.

383
17:04.880 --> 17:05.420
Okay.

384
17:09.290 --> 17:10.849
Sis, wait a minute.

385
17:14.700 --> 17:15.500
Little girl,

386
17:15.790 --> 17:16.660
when it comes to hitting on someone,

387
17:16.660 --> 17:18.089
it's first come, first served. Understand?

388
17:18.089 --> 17:18.849
Besides,

389
17:18.849 --> 17:20.310
who are you calling "Sis"?

390
17:20.940 --> 17:22.400
I'm not here to hit on him.

391
17:24.530 --> 17:25.589
I'm his friend.

392
17:26.349 --> 17:27.440
Besides, in our circle,

393
17:27.440 --> 17:28.900
many people are students.

394
17:29.140 --> 17:30.350
Don't force my friend

395
17:30.350 --> 17:31.400
to drink with you.

396
17:31.850 --> 17:32.650
Otherwise, I'll call

397
17:32.650 --> 17:33.660
the counselor.

398
17:34.940 --> 17:35.790
Counselor?

399
17:36.200 --> 17:37.640
I never thought I'd hear that word

400
17:37.640 --> 17:38.900
in a bar in my life.

401
17:40.660 --> 17:43.160
Why are kids coming to bars?

402
17:53.290 --> 17:53.960
Yun Lili.

403
17:56.050 --> 17:56.530
Sit.

404
18:10.500 --> 18:12.140
Why did you call me

405
18:12.140 --> 18:13.380
Yun Lili?

406
18:13.800 --> 18:15.610
Did you remember my name wrong?

407
18:24.570 --> 18:25.090
Mm.

408
18:28.700 --> 18:29.480
That's fine.

409
18:29.840 --> 18:31.680
You can call me whatever you want.

410
18:31.680 --> 18:32.940
It sounds pretty good.

411
18:36.510 --> 18:37.910
What do you want to drink?

412
18:43.440 --> 18:44.700
What are you drinking?

413
18:45.070 --> 18:45.880
Whiskey.

414
18:46.330 --> 18:47.680
I'll have a whiskey too.

415
18:48.180 --> 18:48.610
Okay.

416
18:48.610 --> 18:49.810
Make her a soft drink.

417
18:49.940 --> 18:50.460
Okay.

418
18:58.770 --> 19:01.110
They all say people come to bars

419
19:01.110 --> 19:03.770
to find a partner.

420
19:04.290 --> 19:05.820
Are you looking for one too?

421
19:11.310 --> 19:12.630
Do you want to find a partner?

422
19:12.630 --> 19:13.500
I don't.

423
19:15.570 --> 19:18.270
You can't answer a question with a question.

424
19:18.960 --> 19:19.750
Why?

425
19:21.310 --> 19:22.220
Because if you ask,

426
19:22.220 --> 19:24.570
I'll seriously think about how to answer.

427
19:24.770 --> 19:25.660
And if I answer,

428
19:25.660 --> 19:26.510
this conversation

429
19:26.510 --> 19:28.160
won't be able to continue.

430
19:34.270 --> 19:36.400
You haven't answered my question yet.

431
19:41.850 --> 19:42.660
I'm not.

432
19:47.980 --> 19:48.770
Thank you.

433
19:59.290 --> 20:00.890
Maybe you should drink less?

434
20:02.220 --> 20:03.010
It's fine.

435
20:08.090 --> 20:09.090
You drink mine.

436
20:09.460 --> 20:11.190
I'll drink with you for a while.

437
20:14.640 --> 20:15.270
It burns.

438
20:19.110 --> 20:19.720
No need.

439
20:19.720 --> 20:20.960
I'll just drink this.

440
20:28.140 --> 20:28.980
Why are you two sitting here

441
20:28.980 --> 20:29.640
chatting?

442
20:29.640 --> 20:30.070
Come play games

443
20:30.070 --> 20:30.750
with us.

444
20:31.030 --> 20:31.560
Let's go.

445
20:33.010 --> 20:33.570
Let's go.

446
20:34.160 --> 20:34.740
Come on.

447
20:35.120 --> 20:35.650
Let's go.

448
20:36.530 --> 20:37.390
Let's go, Lili.

449
20:42.660 --> 20:43.790
Uncle, hurry up too.

450
20:44.090 --> 20:44.510
Hurry.

451
20:53.140 --> 20:53.510
Perfect.

452
20:53.510 --> 20:54.380
Lili, you sit here.

453
20:54.380 --> 20:55.370
I'll teach you how to play Liar's Dice.

454
20:55.370 --> 20:56.570
The rules are very simple.

455
20:56.570 --> 20:57.770
I can teach her that too.

456
20:57.770 --> 21:00.300
Why do you have to get involved in everything?

457
21:06.090 --> 21:06.690
Move over.

458
21:07.200 --> 21:07.590
Okay.

459
21:10.740 --> 21:11.740
Move further out.

460
21:22.590 --> 21:23.090
Uncle,

461
21:23.110 --> 21:24.500
don't steal my seat.

462
21:24.920 --> 21:26.380
I don't want to sit next to Tang Lin.

463
21:26.380 --> 21:27.240
Are you scared?

464
21:27.510 --> 21:29.330
If you beg for mercy now,

465
21:29.480 --> 21:31.740
I might go easy on you.

466
21:33.770 --> 21:34.940
Who's scared of who?

467
21:37.140 --> 21:38.380
Can't you be gentle

468
21:38.380 --> 21:39.220
like Lili?

469
21:41.550 --> 21:41.940
Lili,

470
21:41.940 --> 21:42.830
maybe you should sit here.

471
21:42.830 --> 21:44.560
I feel like my life is in danger.

472
21:47.420 --> 21:48.220
Let's start.

473
21:49.070 --> 21:49.510
Oh, right.

474
21:49.510 --> 21:50.770
Lili doesn't know the rules yet.

475
21:50.770 --> 21:51.530
So,

476
21:51.680 --> 21:52.510
we'll start with me,

477
21:52.510 --> 21:54.030
then Uncle,

478
21:54.030 --> 21:54.530
Lili,

479
21:54.530 --> 21:55.330
and so on.

480
21:55.330 --> 21:55.680
Lili,

481
21:55.680 --> 21:57.140
if you think the person before you

482
21:57.140 --> 21:57.720
is bluffing,

483
21:57.720 --> 21:58.640
you call them out.

484
21:58.640 --> 21:59.880
If you guess right,

485
21:59.880 --> 22:00.530
they drink.

486
22:00.530 --> 22:01.810
If you guess wrong,

487
22:01.830 --> 22:02.740
you drink.

488
22:02.740 --> 22:04.220
Got it?

489
22:05.310 --> 22:06.110
I don't...

490
22:06.110 --> 22:06.710
It's fine.

491
22:07.270 --> 22:09.070
You'll get it after a few rounds.

492
22:10.740 --> 22:12.270
Then let's start with me.

493
22:21.440 --> 22:22.110
Five ones.

494
22:22.980 --> 22:23.500
Call.

495
22:25.770 --> 22:26.680
What are you doing, Uncle?

496
22:26.680 --> 22:28.480
Who would call on the first turn?

497
22:29.740 --> 22:30.220
None.

498
22:30.240 --> 22:31.170
I don't have any.

499
22:31.310 --> 22:32.030
One.

500
22:32.030 --> 22:32.740
One.

501
22:33.310 --> 22:34.570
You lost, Fu Zhengchu.

502
22:34.830 --> 22:36.030
Five people, and we can't even

503
22:36.030 --> 22:37.070
scrape together 5 ones?

504
22:37.070 --> 22:37.880
Drink up.

505
22:39.720 --> 22:40.830
This... My...

506
22:42.980 --> 22:43.980
My drink.

507
22:45.360 --> 22:46.420
We're all friends here.

508
22:46.420 --> 22:47.550
Don't be a stranger.

509
22:48.680 --> 22:49.440
Off to a bad start.

510
22:49.440 --> 22:50.970
Let's start with you again.

511
22:53.160 --> 22:55.420
I don't believe I can lose this round too.

512
22:59.530 --> 23:00.330
Ten sixes.

513
23:00.530 --> 23:02.000
Six... Ten...

514
23:03.980 --> 23:04.770
Call.

515
23:06.000 --> 23:07.830
What are you doing, Uncle?

516
23:09.830 --> 23:11.400
Fu Zhengchu lost again.

517
23:11.400 --> 23:12.590
Hurry up and drink.

518
23:14.480 --> 23:15.270
Mine.

519
23:15.370 --> 23:16.140
Grabbed the wrong one.

520
23:16.140 --> 23:18.140
I'm getting desperate from losing.

521
23:20.200 --> 23:21.000
Come on!

522
23:21.530 --> 23:23.790
I don't believe I can lose this round too.

523
23:24.740 --> 23:25.530
Ten sixes!

524
23:25.530 --> 23:26.270
Call.

525
23:28.570 --> 23:29.380
Drink.

526
23:31.160 --> 23:31.940
Call.

527
23:32.510 --> 23:33.270
Call.

528
23:35.050 --> 23:36.250
Why do you keep losing?

529
23:36.250 --> 23:38.180
Can you do this or not, Fu Zhengchu?

530
23:40.790 --> 23:41.590
Well...

531
23:43.590 --> 23:44.400
Continue.

532
23:46.290 --> 23:47.090
Old Auntie.

533
23:49.420 --> 23:50.960
Tangy, you're so nice.

534
23:52.660 --> 23:53.660
Don't call me that.

535
23:53.660 --> 23:54.920
It's disgusting.

536
23:55.660 --> 23:56.810
You guys are already playing.

537
23:56.810 --> 23:58.010
What are you playing?

538
23:58.250 --> 23:59.220
Playing Liar's Dice.

539
23:59.220 --> 24:00.680
Qingsong, want to join us?

540
24:00.790 --> 24:01.310
Come on.

541
24:01.310 --> 24:02.290
I'm the best at this.

542
24:02.290 --> 24:03.000
Hurry up.

543
24:04.010 --> 24:06.310
Can we start with me next round?

544
24:07.230 --> 24:08.860
I kind of want to try.

545
24:09.400 --> 24:10.200
Good idea.

546
24:10.220 --> 24:11.250
Since Qingsong is here,

547
24:11.250 --> 24:12.610
let's start with Lili.

548
24:12.610 --> 24:13.550
We'll go in the opposite direction.

549
24:13.550 --> 24:15.660
I don't believe I can still lose like this!

550
24:15.660 --> 24:16.550
Come on.

551
24:18.880 --> 24:19.400
Come on.

552
24:27.400 --> 24:28.940
Twelve sixes.

553
24:30.050 --> 24:30.680
Lili,

554
24:30.680 --> 24:32.090
do you want to change it?

555
24:32.090 --> 24:32.900
Twelve sixes.

556
24:32.990 --> 24:35.030
Uncle will definitely call your bluff.

557
24:35.030 --> 24:35.680
It's...

558
24:35.680 --> 24:36.480
Thirteen.

559
24:38.500 --> 24:39.290
Uncle.

560
24:40.000 --> 24:40.790
Thirteen sixes?

561
24:40.790 --> 24:41.720
Are you serious?

562
24:41.900 --> 24:42.700
Your turn.

563
24:44.030 --> 24:45.070
Then I won't hold back.

564
24:45.070 --> 24:45.770
Call!

565
24:47.400 --> 24:49.090
Fu Zhengchu, you lost.

566
24:49.440 --> 24:51.030
There really are 13 sixes.

567
24:52.500 --> 24:53.290
Wait!

568
24:53.400 --> 24:54.500
Something's wrong.

569
24:54.500 --> 24:55.290
Uncle,

570
24:55.640 --> 24:56.330
are you targeting me

571
24:56.330 --> 24:57.640
tonight?

572
25:01.070 --> 25:03.500
Do you have feelings for Lili?

573
25:07.980 --> 25:08.780
You guys play.

574
25:10.750 --> 25:12.150
Come on, let's continue.

575
25:33.240 --> 25:34.200
Cute.

576
25:39.250 --> 25:41.420
Why isn't he back yet?

577
25:46.460 --> 25:47.250
Cute.

578
25:48.380 --> 25:49.720
The cute type.

579
25:49.880 --> 25:50.680
You lost again.

580
25:50.680 --> 25:51.160
Tangy,

581
25:51.360 --> 25:52.890
I'm going to the restroom.

582
25:54.350 --> 25:55.380
You can't beat me.

583
26:05.860 --> 26:06.660
Fu Shize.

584
26:14.050 --> 26:14.850
Yun Lili.

585
26:19.310 --> 26:20.840
You've been here all along?

586
26:22.350 --> 26:22.850
Mm.

587
26:23.180 --> 26:24.960
Then why didn't I see you?

588
26:25.510 --> 26:26.840
Were you looking for me?

589
26:27.400 --> 26:27.900
Yeah.

590
26:28.600 --> 26:29.800
I was looking for you.

591
26:30.680 --> 26:32.510
I-I'm here to take you back.

592
26:34.810 --> 26:35.670
Where are they?

593
26:36.480 --> 26:39.070
They drank a bit too much.

594
26:39.270 --> 26:40.640
They can barely walk.

595
26:44.920 --> 26:45.720
Let's go back.

596
26:46.220 --> 26:46.720
Yeah.

597
27:14.510 --> 27:16.040
Do you want some sweet soup?

598
27:18.070 --> 27:19.660
When I'm in a bad mood,

599
27:19.660 --> 27:22.720
I want to drink something sweet.

600
27:24.050 --> 27:25.220
Are you in a bad mood?

601
27:27.550 --> 27:28.050
Yeah.

602
27:29.050 --> 27:29.850
What's wrong?

603
27:31.920 --> 27:35.270
I just felt that you were in a bad mood,

604
27:35.270 --> 27:36.270
so I thought...

605
27:37.270 --> 27:38.070
What?

606
27:40.880 --> 27:42.070
Forget it if you can't hear me.

607
27:42.070 --> 27:43.200
Do you want it or not?

608
27:47.480 --> 27:48.980
Let me drink.

609
27:48.980 --> 27:49.880
You can't drink.

610
27:49.880 --> 27:50.660
You really can't drink.

611
27:50.660 --> 27:51.990
How did she get so drunk?

612
27:52.270 --> 27:53.070
Fu Zhengchu,

613
27:53.250 --> 27:54.160
Qingsong and I

614
27:54.160 --> 27:55.770
have to go talk to Sang Yan about something.

615
27:55.770 --> 27:57.220
Take Tangy home for me.

616
27:57.270 --> 27:58.510
Why should I take her?

617
28:00.480 --> 28:02.010
Just do it when you're told.

618
28:02.070 --> 28:03.270
Cut the nonsense.

619
28:03.880 --> 28:04.680
Hurry up.

620
28:05.210 --> 28:06.820
What about Uncle and Lili?

621
28:08.110 --> 28:09.840
They'll go home by themselves.

622
28:10.010 --> 28:11.940
You don't need to worry about them.

623
28:13.350 --> 28:13.830
Hurry, hurry.

624
28:13.830 --> 28:14.480
Got it, got it.

625
28:14.480 --> 28:15.280
Give me a hand.

626
28:16.480 --> 28:17.180
Watch her.

627
28:17.180 --> 28:18.380
Don't let her drink anymore.

628
28:18.380 --> 28:20.310
Where are you going, Xia?

629
28:20.310 --> 28:20.920
Got it.

630
28:20.920 --> 28:22.120
Let's keep drinking.

631
28:22.550 --> 28:23.350
Drink.

632
28:24.250 --> 28:25.070
Okay.

633
28:25.420 --> 28:26.480
Let's go somewhere else to continue drinking.

634
28:26.480 --> 28:26.980
Let's go.

635
28:26.980 --> 28:27.920
Who are you?

636
28:29.050 --> 28:29.920
Are you okay?

637
28:30.010 --> 28:31.460
Who are you?

638
28:32.220 --> 28:33.130
It's me,

639
28:33.340 --> 28:34.750
Fu Zhengchu.

640
28:36.380 --> 28:37.730
Fu Zhengchu.

641
28:38.680 --> 28:40.740
Fu Zhengzhu is a jerk!

642
28:44.460 --> 28:47.000
Fu Zhengzhi is a jerk.

643
28:51.770 --> 28:53.530
Fu Zhengchu.

644
29:02.790 --> 29:04.770
I've done so much.

645
29:05.180 --> 29:06.640
Isn't it obvious?

646
29:07.140 --> 29:08.270
What are you saying?

647
29:09.330 --> 29:11.000
I'm older than you,

648
29:11.570 --> 29:13.940
hanging around you every day.

649
29:14.530 --> 29:15.640
I just want you

650
29:15.640 --> 29:17.000
to look at me more.

651
29:17.790 --> 29:18.940
Am I not pretty?

652
29:21.400 --> 29:22.260
You are pretty.

653
29:22.790 --> 29:23.740
Very pretty.

654
29:24.700 --> 29:25.770
Then why

655
29:25.770 --> 29:27.570
do you always call me Old Auntie?

656
29:28.380 --> 29:29.660
Am I very old?

657
29:30.870 --> 29:31.650
You're not old.

658
29:31.650 --> 29:32.680
Of course not.

659
29:32.680 --> 29:33.880
You are young and pretty.

660
29:33.880 --> 29:35.810
Forever young and forever pretty.

661
29:36.000 --> 29:37.140
Do you know

662
29:37.590 --> 29:39.140
why I drank for you?

663
29:39.400 --> 29:41.400
Do you think I like drinking?

664
29:42.070 --> 29:44.520
I thought you liked drinking.

665
29:45.550 --> 29:46.700
Do you know

666
29:47.020 --> 29:47.760
why I

667
29:47.790 --> 29:48.770
put such an ugly seat

668
29:48.770 --> 29:50.950
on the back of my bike?

669
29:52.480 --> 29:54.740
Isn't it because you think it looks good?

670
30:00.090 --> 30:03.400
It's all because of you.

671
30:08.940 --> 30:09.860
Fu Zhengchu.

672
30:13.140 --> 30:14.460
I like you.

673
30:48.140 --> 30:49.200
Try this.

674
30:51.030 --> 30:51.750
No need.

675
30:57.440 --> 30:58.240
Fu Shize,

676
30:59.500 --> 31:02.290
are we friends?

677
31:04.900 --> 31:07.200
Friends should share.

678
31:15.400 --> 31:16.830
One for you,

679
31:18.250 --> 31:19.420
and one for me.

680
31:32.470 --> 31:33.900
This dessert...

681
31:35.480 --> 31:37.140
You want to share half with me?

682
32:07.330 --> 32:07.930
Forget it.

683
32:12.240 --> 32:12.980
It's fine.

684
32:13.580 --> 32:14.410
Anyway, my order

685
32:14.410 --> 32:15.800
wasn't very good.

686
32:17.750 --> 32:19.310
Should we just go back?

687
32:25.830 --> 32:27.360
I think this is pretty good.

688
32:29.070 --> 32:30.670
Let's finish it before we go.

689
33:04.500 --> 33:06.630
I feel like you're not very happy.

690
33:08.790 --> 33:10.960
Do you want to go back and rest early?

691
33:15.900 --> 33:17.430
Let's stay out a bit longer.

692
33:29.290 --> 33:30.090
I said

693
33:31.740 --> 33:33.400
I want to stay out a bit longer.

694
33:35.240 --> 33:36.030
Is that okay?

695
